/*
 * Coherent bot conversations. Each exchange alternates between the initiating bot and a nearby partner.
 * Topics describe the scene. IDLE dialogue is suitable for any social activity.
 * In Woodcutting and Fishing, {level} is the speaking bot's base level for that skill.
 * Legacy inner arrays remain supported as general IDLE conversations.
 */
