  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["saving for anything?", "better gear if i can stop spending"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["got a quest in mind?", "probably an easy one first"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats your least fav skill?", "changes every time i train one"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do u keep the stuff u train with?", "usually keep it for the next lvl"]
