  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats the first thing u saved up for?", "some armour i think"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do u ever sort your bank?", "only when i cant find anything"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["if u had 100k what would u buy?", "id save most of it for supplies"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["you got time for another level?", "maybe a small one :)"]
