  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["wheres a good place to meet ppl?", "somewhere with a bank usually"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["how do u pick what to train?", "i see which lvl needs the least xp"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["would u rather buy gear or save?", "save till i can get what i want"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do u bother with all the quests?", "just the ones i need atm"]
