  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["how do u remember item prices?", "i ask someone before i buy"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["which looks better rune or addy?", "rune, but addy is cheaper"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["you ever get tired of chasing levels?", "yeah, sometimes i just wander a bit"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats an easy target for today?", "one lvl you know you can finish"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do you think trim is worth it?", "only if u like how it looks"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["what do you do first when u log on?", "look at my stats and try to remember the plan"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do u stick with one skill?", "only if im close to a lvl"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["what are you putting off?", "bank sorting as usual"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["ever make a goal then change it?", "all the time lol"]
  },
  {
