  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do u sell all ur spare stuff?", "usually keep some for later"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["what made u pick that name?", "took me a few tries to get one i liked"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats the best thing to have spare of?", "food probably"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats the longest u can train one thing?", "depends how close i am to the next lvl"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["always something else to do on here", "yep, thats how i get sidetracked"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["u rather pay more or wait?", "wait if i dont need it yet"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["what lvl is a good stopping point?", "whatever u can get before u get bored"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats ur favourite quest reward?", "anything that saves a walk"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["can u train without checking ur xp?", "i try then check it anyway"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["do u have to be rich to dress well?", "nah, some cheap stuff looks good"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["too many things i want to get", "pick one and save for that"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["ever spend more than u meant to?", "yep, usually starts with just having a look"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["whats a skill u always go back to?", "one i can do without much setup"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["why do i always keep all the cheap stuff?", "because the day u sell it youll need one"]
