  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["have any good little goals?", "get one more lvl than yesterday"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["you can spend forever looking at gear", "easier if u set a price first"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["did u find it easy to get started?", "got the hang of it after a while"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["reckon i should buy supplies in bulk?", "only if ur sure you'll use them"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["going for total or combat levels?", "total for now"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["how long till u get bored of training?", "if there are people to talk to, a while"]
