  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["should i do the long quests first?", "get a few short ones out of the way"]
  },
  {
    "topics": ["IDLE"],
    "lines": ["wonder whats the most useful thing to buy", "something you'll use most trips"]
  },
  {
